+/// ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
+///
+/// Parameter           | Description
+/// --------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------
+/// __ctx__             | Must point to an previously initialized `nk_context` struct after calling a layouting function
