+ * Original author: Markus G. Kuhn <mkuhn@acm.org>, University of
+ *                  Cambridge, April 2001
+ *
+ * Special thanks to Richard Verhoeven <river@win.tue.nl> for preparing
+ * an initial draft of the mapping table.
+ *
+ */
